  basic FAT_MBUF/FWBUF $E7C0..$E9BF hosts 16 cell(s) of the other map: WRBLK_REC $E7E8, WRBLK_RECSEC $E7EB, WRBLK_RS $E7EC, WRBLK_CNT $E7EE, WRBLK_REQ $E7F0, WRBLK_PREVCLUS $E7F2 …
  basic CAL_BUF2 $E800..$E8FF hosts 4 cell(s) of the other map: DRV_TRAMP $E800, BDOS_SEQREC $E814, DBUF_PTR $E816, MBUF_PTR $E818
  disk  STRSCR $E26D..$E36C hosts 1 cell(s) of the other map: STRSCR $E26D
  disk  FAT_DBUF/SECTOR_BUF $E2A0..$E49F hosts 25 cell(s) of the other map: TEMPPOOL $E381, ISRCH_A/TEMPBASE $E3E1, ISRCH_B $E3E3, GFX_BAD/STRENG_SPARE $E3E5, MIDS_DEST $E3E6, GFX_PTOP $E3E8 …
  disk  FAT_MBUF/WBUF $E560..$E75F hosts 2 cell(s) of the other map: FAT_DBUF/FSECTOR_BUF $E5C0, CAL_BUF/CAS_WBUF $E600
  disk  FSECTOR_BUF $E5C0..$E7BF hosts 2 cell(s) of the other map: FAT_DBUF/FSECTOR_BUF $E5C0, CAL_BUF/CAS_WBUF $E600
